### 🕵️‍♂️ A little about the architecture...

NEXUS Mesh is an enterprise-grade, multi-chain Verification & Settlement Mesh. Actions within this architecture are always aimed at achieving deterministic finality and high-speed data routing. In design, it is guided by trust-minimization and atomic composability; it never stands still.

Currently, the engine is focused on handling decentralized, satellite-independent mesh networks and autonomous routing logic for high-performance applications.

